  "bio": "Daniel Marcotte is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the 'sketch' style, with a keen eye for detail that brings each piece of art to life on the skin. Stationed in Charleston, SC, at the reputable Iron Lotus Studios, Daniel maintains a pristine work environment, ensuring every client's experience is not only artistically exceptional but also held to the highest standards of cleanliness. To book an appointment with this meticulous professional, give a call or visit the studio in person, as Daniel prefers direct interaction over social media messages.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Charleston, South Carolina, United States"
